OL,3,GNEWSAArrests after four-vehicle crash
OL,4,Aon A143
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo arrests have been made following a
OL,7,Ffour-vehicle crash in which a driver
OL,8,Fsuffered potentially life-changing
OL,9,Finjuries on the A143.
OL,11,FSuffolk Police said the collision
OL,12,Finvolved a black BMW M140i, a grey BMW
OL,13,F635 coupe, a green Claas forage
OL,14,Fharvester and a blue New Holland
OL,15,Ftractor between Ixworth and Stanton
OL,16,Fjust before 08:00 BST on Saturday.
OL,18,FThe driver of the coupe - a man in his
OL,19,F50s - had to be freed by firefighters
OL,20,Fand was taken to hospital, the force
OL,21,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
