OL,3,GNEWSAArrests after four-vehicle crash
OL,4,Aon A143
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 48-year-old man driving the other BMW
OL,7,Fwas arrested on suspicion of causing
OL,8,Fserious injury by dangerous driving and
OL,9,Ffailing to stop after an accident. The
OL,10,Ftractor driver, a 24-year-old man, was
OL,11,Fheld on suspicion of drug-driving.
